  "mechanism": {
    "name": "Continuous-proxy double negative control test-negative design",
    "title_en": null,
    "family_id": "li-shi-miao-tchetgen-2024-continuous-tnd",
    "generation_equations": [
      "取 `σ(t)=1/(1+exp(-t))`。对来源总体独立个体依次生成：",
      "1. `U ~ Uniform(0,1)`，`X ~ Uniform(0,1)`；两者独立。",
      "2. `A | U,X ~ Bernoulli(σ(-1 + U + 0.25X))`。",
      "3. `Z = 0.25A + 0.25X + 5U + εZ`。",
      "4. `W = 0.25X + 2U + εW`。",
      "5. `Y | A,U,X ~ Bernoulli(exp(η0 + βA - 2U - 0.25X - 0.75UX))`，`η0=ln(0.01)`。",
      "6. `D | U,X ~ Bernoulli(exp(-4.605 + 0.25X - 0.2U))`。",
      "7. `S | Y,D,U,X ~ Bernoulli(max(Y,D) × σ(-1.4 + 0.5X + 2U + UX))`。",
      "`εZ` 与 `εW` 为独立 `Normal(0,0.25²)`，并独立于 `U,X` 及二元节点的随机数。最终只返回 `S=1` 个体的观测列 `X,A,Z,W,Y`；内部变量为 `U,D,S`。连续协变量 `X` 的边界是 `[0,1]`；连续代理与正态噪声无固定数值截断。",
      "四个场景均固定 `η0=log(0.01)`，只改变处理效应 `β∈{log(0.2), log(0.5), log(0.7), 0}`。\r"
    ],
